"README.md": r'''# Automora AI

Automora is a prototype for an AI-powered customer communication and business automation workspace designed for small businesses.

## MVP concept

- Unified inbox-style view for customer conversations
- Customer profiles and conversation status
- AI-assisted reply composer (prototype UI; no live AI call yet)
- Follow-up automation preview
- Basic activity and performance metrics

## Current status

This repository contains a **frontend prototype with sample data**. It does not yet connect to WhatsApp, email, an external CRM, a database, or an AI provider. Do not describe those integrations as implemented until they are connected and tested.

## Run locally

Requirements: Node.js 18+ and npm.

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Open the local URL shown by Vite.

## Production build

```bash
npm run build
npm run preview
```

## Suggested next steps

1. Validate the interface against the approved Figma design.
2. Add authentication and role-based access.
3. Add a backend API and database for customers and conversations.
4. Integrate an approved messaging provider and consent-aware workflows.
5. Connect an AI provider through a server-side endpoint; keep keys out of the browser.
6. Add tests, privacy controls, logging, and deployment configuration.

## Design and planning

- Figma: https://www.figma.com/design/6x59zaDsPHxv1Dh4DZCrpm/Automora
- Miro: https://miro.com/app/board/uXjVEUYMiFw=/

## License

No license has been selected yet. Add a license only after deciding how you want others to use the source code.
